fns defined in one part are directly","+  visible to the others — no `pub` / `use` needed between parts.","+* The first line must be a normal `//` comment, **never** a `//!` inner doc","+  comment (illegal in an included file).","+* Do not add `#![...]` inner attributes.","+* Do not touch the wrapper `src/<name>.rs` or any other part file.","+","+If you are assigned a whole module file (`src/<name>.rs`), start it with","+","+```rust","+//! Translated from c_src/src/<name>.c","+","+use crate::prelude::*;","+```","+"," ### `PNG_WARNING_PARAMETERS(p)` / `png_warning_parameters`"," "," `png_warning_parameters p;` becomes"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
