*png_ptr).zstream, flush)`,\n158\t`inflateReset2`, `inflateReset`, `inflateValidate`, `inflateEnd`,\n159\t`deflateInit2(&mut (*png_ptr).zstream, level, method, wb, memLevel, strategy)`,\n160\t`deflate`, `deflateReset`, `deflateEnd`, `crc32(crc, ptr, len)`.\n161\t`ZLIB_VERNUM` is 0x12b0 (>= 0x1240), so compile the \"modern zlib\" branches.\n162\t`PNGZ_MSG_CAST(s)` is just `s`; `PNGZ_INPUT_CAST(b)` is just `b`.\n163\t`ZLIB_IO_MAX` is `crate::zlib::ZLIB_IO_MAX` (`u32::MAX`).\n164\t\n165\t### `png_debug*`\n166\t\n167\tAll `png_debug`, `png_debug1`, `png_debug2` calls are no-ops — just delete them.\n168\t\n169\t### `PNG_UNUSED(x)`\n170\t\n171\tDelete.\n172\t\n173\t## 5. Which `#ifdef`s are ON\n174\t\n175\tTreat these as **defined** (see `c_src/include/pnglibconf.h` for the full list —\n176\tessentially everything except the CPU-specific optimizations):\n177\t\n178\t* All `PNG_READ_*`, `PNG_WRITE_*`, chunk support, `PNG_SETJMP_SUPPORTED`,\n179\t  `PNG_USER_MEM_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_USER_LIMITS_SUPPORTED`,\n180\t  `PNG_SET_USER_LIMITS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_FLOATING_POINT_SUPPORTED`,\n181\t  `PNG_FIXED_POINT_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_FLOATING_ARITHMETIC_SUPPORTED`,\n182\t  `PNG_STDIO_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_CONSOLE_IO_SUPPORTED`,\n183\t  `PNG_PROGRESSIVE_READ_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_SEQUENTIAL_READ_SUPPORTED`,\n184\t  `PNG_SIMPLIFIED_READ_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_SIMPLIFIED_WRITE_SUPPORTED`,\n185\t  `PNG_COLORSPACE_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_GAMMA_SUPPORTED`,\n186\t  `PNG_BENIGN_ERRORS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_BENIGN_READ_ERRORS_SUPPORTED`,\n187\t  `PNG_WARNINGS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_ERROR_TEXT_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_TEXT_SUPPORTED`,\n188\t  `PNG_TIME_RFC1123_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_CONVERT_tIME_SUPPORTED`,\n189\t  `PNG_EASY_ACCESS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_INCH_CONVERSIONS_SUPPORTED`,\n190\t  `PNG_IO_STATE_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_MNG_FEATURES_SUPPORTED`,\n191\t  `PNG_SET_OPTION_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_UNKNOWN_CHUNKS_SUPPORTED` (+ READ/WRITE/SET/STORE/SAVE variants),\n192\t  `PNG_USER_CHUNKS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_HANDLE_AS_UNKNOWN_SUPPORTED`,\n193\t  `PNG_CHECK_FOR_INVALID_INDEX_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_GET_PALETTE_MAX_SUPPORTED`,\n194\t  `PNG_INFO_IMAGE_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_POINTER_INDEXING_SUPPORTED`,\n195\t  `PNG_16BIT_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_ALIGNED_MEMORY_SUPPORTED`,\n196\t  `PNG_BUILD_GRAYSCALE_PALETTE_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_READ_COMPOSITE_NODIV_SUPPORTED`,\n197\t  `PNG_USE_READ_MACROS`, `PNG_WRITE_OPTIMIZE_CMF_SUPPORTED`,\n198\t  `PNG_WRITE_CUSTOMIZE_COMPRESSION_SUPPORTED`,\n199\t  `PNG_WRITE_CUSTOMIZE_ZTXT_COMPRESSION_SUPPORTED`,\n200\t  `PNG_WRITE_WEIGHTED_FILTER_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_WRITE_FILTER_SUPPORTED`,\n201\t  `PNG_WRITE_FLUSH_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_FORMAT_BGR_SUPPORTED`,\n202\t  `PNG_FORMAT_AFIRST_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_SIMPLIFIED_*_BGR/AFIRST/STDIO_SUPPORTED`,\n203\t  `PNG_SAVE_INT_32_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_READ_INT_FUNCTIONS_SUPPORTED`,\n204\t  `PNG_WRITE_INT_FUNCTIONS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_USER_TRANSFORM_*`.\n205\t\n206\tTreat these as **NOT defined** (omit the code entirely):\n207\t\n208\t* `PNG_ERROR_NUMBERS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_DISABLE_ADLER32_CHECK_SUPPORTED`,\n209\t  `PNG_BENIGN_WRITE_ERRORS_SUPPORTED`, `PNG_FIXED_POINT_MACRO_SUPPORTED`,\n210\t  `PNG_MAX_MALLOC_64K`, `PNG_ARM_NEON_*`, `PNG_MIPS_*`, `PNG_POWERPC_*`,\n211\t  `PNG_LOONGARCH_*`, `PNG_INTEL_SSE`, `PNG_RISCV_*`, `PNG_FILTER_OPTIMIZATIONS`,\n212\t  `PNG_ARM_NEON_IMPLEMENTATION`, `PNG_RISCV_RVV_IMPLEMENTATION`,\n213\t  `PNG_USER_CONFIG`, `PNG_PREFIX`, `PNG_READ_QUANTIZE_SUPPORTED` is **ON**,\n214\t  `PNG_READ_OPT_PLTE_SUPPORTED` is **ON**.\n215\t* `PNG_RELEASE_BUILD` is **false** (`PNG_LIBPNG_BUILD_BASE_TYPE` == BETA == 2\n216\t  which is `< PNG_LIBPNG_BUILD_RC` == 3), so inside\n217\t  `#if PNG_RELEASE_BUILD ... #else ... #endif` you must take the **`#else`**\n218\t  branch, and `#if !PNG_RELEASE_BUILD` code IS compiled.\n219\t* `PNG_LIBPNG_VER < 10700` is **true**.\n220\t* `PNG_ARM_NEON_OPT`, `PNG_INTEL_SSE_IMPLEMENTATION`, etc. are all `0`.\n221\t\n222\t## 6. Verification\n223\t\n224\tAfter writing the file, run\n225\t\n226\t```\n227\tcargo build --release --offline 2>&1 | tail -40\n228\t```\n229\t\n230\tOt